 to the fragile fabric of society.", "short_description": "As one of a small number of citizens who have been endowed with the power to move objects with their minds, you have been enrolled by the government to undertake a series of tests to show that you are in control of your powers.\n\nGAME FEATURES\n\n6 challenging chapters to play through\nPhysics based puzzles solvable with ESP telekinetic powers\nWorld class voice acting from Eric Meyers"}]}, "developer_name": "Coatsink", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://coatsink.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://coatsink.com/", "publisher_name": "Coatsink", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://coatsink.com/games/esper", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["NARRATIVE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "504821664501006"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12427628_171653466790151_1396495194521600000_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9rAjFxz92vMQ7kNvwHLigfm&_nc_oc=AdrvCNAbY6cQgRXEDLzdkuZ-YtHHMHXQQ6DbCmHqRiAd_f9SUre54mPMapw794dxNKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW91d8XJ8xKy7WZeTeU5z59c-F65OQlIhPzxuAmEM3v0A&oe=6B105E1C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Esper", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1430